# weather_update on its own, with area_update, from 22:00 on the last day (34) of the last month (16): the night
# turns into a new day, month and year, then the day comes and goes again. Decimus (10) stands in the temple
# square (3005), outside; Purser (10) is in the temple (3001), inside; Delver (2) sleeps in the square.
# - the hour, day, month and year roll over
# - "The day has begun." at 5 and "The sun rises in the east." at 6 (sic, #85), "The sun slowly disappears in the
#   west." at 19 and "The night has begun." at 20, only to Decimus
# - the pressure and the sky change each tick, for 70 ticks, with what Decimus is told of it
# - time and weather, after
@clock 1764176595
@updates area,weather
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
south
@connect purse
Purser
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect delver
Delver
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
transfer delver 3005
@as delver
sleep
@as dec
time
weather
@pulse 480
time
@pulse 1920
time
weather
@pulse 3600
time
weather
@pulse 1440
time
weather
@pulse 9600
time
weather
@state
